UnitCLPool::PublicSettleToBlock
├── when the caller is not the gauge
│   └── it should revert with NG
└── when the caller is the gauge
    ├── when there is no rollover accumulated
    │   └── it should return zero
    └── when there is rollover accumulated
        ├── it should settle to the current block
        ├── it should return the accumulated rollover
        └── it should clear the rollover
